    decisions: ["Freeze the eligible list at publish time with the rule version. Later record edits do not silently add or remove students; any change needs a logged override with a reason.","Enforce the one-offer policy in the database with a row lock on the student's placement status and a partial unique index on accepted offers per season, not in application code alone.","Make the policy configurable per institute: block on offer release versus on acceptance, and dream or super-dream tiers that allow one upgrade. Version the policy so past decisions can be replayed.","Keep the audit ledger append-only and hash-chained, and derive statistics from it so published reports and individual records cannot disagree.","Collect panel feedback blind and lock it on submission to reduce anchoring, and keep recruiter access limited to their own drive's candidates."],
